# office domain (ADR-014; the work domain, R128/R129)
# Routed through a NetVM, persistent, with identity. Writer, Calc and Impress
# with the GTK3 front end; no Java. Installed without recommends (the
# foundation's apt configuration), so no default-jre comes in by Recommends.
# The `libreoffice` executable is on the vm-agent RUN whitelist (R130).
libreoffice-writer
libreoffice-calc
libreoffice-impress
libreoffice-gtk3
foot
pcmanfm
